{"id":"f205978a7c11015b","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-function.md","title":"内建的集合函数图","display":"df-function — 内建的集合函数图","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-function","aliases":["16-df-function","Function"],"display":"df-function — 内建的集合函数图","depends_on":[],"source":"§0.2 pp. 11–18 (PDF 31–38), set semantics; local graph encoding","revision_date":"2026-10-15"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-function</span><span>Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-function — 内建的集合函数图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source","html":"§0.2 pp. 11–18 (PDF 31–38), set semantics; local graph encoding"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,A,B\">\\(f,A,B\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span> 采用标准有序对编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\times B\">\\(A\\times B\\)</span> 为集合积。本页不使用范畴中带源靶标签的箭头编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(f,A,B)\\Longleftrightarrow\nf\\subseteq A\\times B\\land(\\forall x\\in A)(\\exists!y\\in B)\\ \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(f,A,B)\\Longleftrightarrow\nf\\subseteq A\\times B\\land(\\forall x\\in A)(\\exists!y\\in B)\\ \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源背景：§0.2, pp. 11–18 (PDF 31–38) 的集合与函数模型。本页把所需集合函数图展开为标准集合论条件，不再经第58本转引；空定义域的唯一函数图为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>。本书范畴箭头的源靶标签另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源背景：§0.2, pp. 11–18 (PDF 31–38) 的集合与函数模型。本页把所需集合函数图展开为标准集合论条件，不再经第58本转引；空定义域的唯一函数图为 $\\varnothing$。本书范畴箭头的源靶标签另见 [[16-df-set]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f,A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A\\times B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(f,A,B)\\Longleftrightarrow\nf\\subseteq A\\times B\\land(\\forall x\\in A)(\\exists!y\\in B)\\ \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":990,"backlinks":[{"id":"f993a9408cb8e9d4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"526d014f8a51723a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,F,P$ 为固定大小约定内的小集合，采用 [[16-df-set]]；$\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P$ 为候选集合函数图，不预设其型属或全函数条件。$\\mathsf{Function}_{16}$ 采用 [[16-df-function]] 的图谓词。"},{"id":"093190b59177ac14","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I,J$ 为集合，$\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(u,I,J)$ 采用 [[16-df-function]]；$u(i)$ 表示函数图的唯一取值。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]、[[16-df-formula]]、[[16-df-provable]]、[[16-df-satisfaction]]、[[16-df-validity-fo]]、[[16-df-type-interpretation]]、[[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]、[[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-coherent-category]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]。"}],"outgoing":["09b2ae01fb2d54e3"]}